
=== chunks written through the wrapper, then the manifest naming them
  put chunk c0
  put chunk c2
  put manifest one [c0 c2]
  drain
--- target
  chunk c0
  chunk c2
  manifest one

=== the dedup hole: a manifest whose chunks were never written here
  put chunk c4 straight to main, bypassing the wrapper
  put manifest copy [c0 c4]
  drain
--- target
  chunk c0
  chunk c2
  chunk c4
  manifest copy
  manifest one

=== a symlink names no chunks
  put manifest link -> ../one
  drain
--- target
  chunk c0
  chunk c2
  chunk c4
  manifest copy
  manifest link
  manifest one

=== rename: copy then delete, in that order on the target too
  copy one -> moved
  delete one
  drain
--- target
  chunk c0
  chunk c2
  chunk c4
  manifest copy
  manifest link
  manifest moved

=== copy whose source the target never had
  put manifest orphan [c6] and chunk c6 straight to main
  copy orphan -> orphan2
  drain
--- target
  chunk c0
  chunk c2
  chunk c4
  chunk c6
  manifest copy
  manifest link
  manifest moved
  manifest orphan2

=== sync bookkeeping is not a target's business
  put journal entry
  put cursor
  drain
  journal on main: true, on target: false
  cursor on main: true, on target: false
--- target
  chunk c0
  chunk c2
  chunk c4
  chunk c6
  manifest copy
  manifest link
  manifest moved
  manifest orphan2

=== a deleted chunk is pushed again when it is written again
  delete chunk c0
  drain
--- target
  chunk c2
  chunk c4
  chunk c6
  manifest copy
  manifest link
  manifest moved
  manifest orphan2
  put chunk c0 again
  drain
--- target
  chunk c0
  chunk c2
  chunk c4
  chunk c6
  manifest copy
  manifest link
  manifest moved
  manifest orphan2

=== an unreachable target is logged, never fatal
  put chunk c8, put manifest safe, copy safe -> safe2, delete safe2
  drain
  manifest safe on main: true
  chunk c8 on main: true

=== reads never consult a target
  get chunk c2 = "bbbb"
  get_opt an absent chunk = none
